      "file": "mb_s1_03.ogg",
      "text": "不过是个菜鸟游侠，兄弟们围上去捉活的！",
      "bytes": 22194,
      "sha256": "512124e84e66170125b2db9d1eaf78cdf3a31c379d6b7bd4510544e393fc14ee"
    },
    "mb_s2_01": {
      "id": "mb_s2_01",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "mb_s2_01.ogg",
      "text": "等等，这小子有点东西，大家别轻敌，快找掩体！",
      "bytes": 28286,
      "sha256": "617bc7c2a5e8104fc11ed6665ee00531b38f282d8a39a33d40ec0f18f05b05eb"
    },
    "mb_s2_02": {
      "id": "mb_s2_02",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "mb_s2_02.ogg",
      "text": "这家伙认词挺稳的，收起轻视，注意互相掩护！",
      "bytes": 27239,
      "sha256": "52b11153cfb37e5e25155b3c47318479ab8e7a0b942a9a6ad8229711720f2001"
    },
    "mb_s2_03": {
      "id": "mb_s2_03",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "mb_s2_03.ogg",
      "text": "不好对付，先把词盾护紧，别随便露头！",
      "bytes": 21791,
      "sha256": "4bdea8abd10d3e618ebbcd194a1a3b87c0c695e821a7498f80a615c22093d3ee"
    },
    "mb_s3_01": {
      "id": "mb_s3_01",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "mb_s3_01.ogg",
      "text": "天哪，他枪法也太准了，英语单词怎么全认识？！",
      "bytes": 27443,
      "sha256": "831a3e5f1660649fbf87739fe513f492867bbd86bbd18863069ff0458e8f969d"
    },
    "mb_s3_02": {
      "id": "mb_s3_02",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "mb_s3_02.ogg",
      "text": "这游侠不一般，连破好几面词盾，词汇量太吓人了！",
      "bytes": 30406,
      "sha256": "b54eeec5a63e6afc32abfa18ecc074ef89e7cbfe6ccb8873ca781e770d80dd1d"
    },
    "mb_s3_03": {
      "id": "mb_s3_03",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "mb_s3_03.ogg",
      "text": "真是高手，一枪一个准，英语比咱们全营都厉害！",
      "bytes": 29821,
      "sha256": "b3831ec344412fd57c5f005dd5388d3668efb47e6514984a653127b7ca7988c7"
    },
    "mb_s4_01": {
      "id": "mb_s4_01",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "mb_s4_01.ogg",
      "text": "快撤快撤！那位可怕的游侠又靠过来了，别跟他硬拼！",
      "bytes": 29912,
      "sha256": "08e1844283667f56ae61466887c7e82e2e5c49af75d21ff1c4706cdb00cb0aa0"
    },
    "mb_s4_02": {
      "id": "mb_s4_02",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "mb_s4_02.ogg",
      "text": "完蛋了，他朝这边走过来了，快躲到掩体后面去！",
      "bytes": 24852,
      "sha256": "11c71363d0bddda3cda8380b4eb93b36707ff8ce5c215c9f2d42f2c798cdd51c"
    },
    "mb_s4_03": {
      "id": "mb_s4_03",
      "group": "mistbound_soldier",
      "speaker": "雾隐词兵",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "agile_young_mountain_scout",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "mb_s4_03.ogg",
      "text": "我打不过他啊！枪法那么准还什么词都认识，快跑！",
      "bytes": 30326,
      "sha256": "74210949c24b91643cdd6a47a4b20e9241966fab4840ff16b6791347b12aa233"
    },
    "ag_s1_01": {
      "id": "ag_s1_01",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage1",
      "file": "ag_s1_01.ogg",
      "text": "哟，就凭你也敢闯阿萨拉？赶紧投降，省得挨揍！",
      "bytes": 31348,
      "sha256": "fb8f85ce10bf36ae89e03e26d5b93220cf5dfcaed1a8e4291cd931d105d931a0"
    },
    "ag_s1_02": {
      "id": "ag_s1_02",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage1",
      "file": "ag_s1_02.ogg",
      "text": "哈哈，这身手也太菜了，弟兄们一起上，抓住他！",
      "bytes": 29607,
      "sha256": "3fefcb1c10bf7cb649ca096244a481e85491618e3579afc121d35fb9183385dc"
    },
    "ag_s1_03": {
      "id": "ag_s1_03",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage1",
      "file": "ag_s1_03.ogg",
      "text": "外来小鬼，连咱俩练练的资格都没有！",
      "bytes": 25717,
      "sha256": "ca2e2830f59b37f4397378c10d62f166bfd2c0325749c8f59a04bfcb536327a0"
    },
    "ag_s2_01": {
      "id": "ag_s2_01",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "ag_s2_01.ogg",
      "text": "喂，这人枪口稳得很，大家提高警惕，别大意！",
      "bytes": 29559,
      "sha256": "bbded932f3ee4634b90ee1692dfe5af459ed913ae421385caa483b4c744c787f"
    },
    "ag_s2_02": {
      "id": "ag_s2_02",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "ag_s2_02.ogg",
      "text": "别往前瞎冲了，他记单词准着呢，先依托沙袋防守！",
      "bytes": 30500,
      "sha256": "88338e345e11060cce1c42bc08effe37dd3d103c1b3c821cb4e1c9a468fc36a2"
    },
    "ag_s2_03": {
      "id": "ag_s2_03",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "ag_s2_03.ogg",
      "text": "情况不对，这不是普通菜鸟，注意侧翼掩护！",
      "bytes": 28615,
      "sha256": "f8543f8eb55d638885435feec187b9bd410175e5f088082283c14a335ff48e30"
    },
    "ag_s3_01": {
      "id": "ag_s3_01",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "ag_s3_01.ogg",
      "text": "乖乖，他枪法怎么这么神，英文词盾根本挡不住他！",
      "bytes": 29921,
      "sha256": "bd60d165d4dc78f380d42635eb191dd81041896a3c16ec2c96dd931ca7aa82a5"
    },
    "ag_s3_02": {
      "id": "ag_s3_02",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "ag_s3_02.ogg",
      "text": "这家伙英语单词认得真多，咱们小队快被他拆光了！",
      "bytes": 32279,
      "sha256": "0e1fc15f2d21c0d32f8cbf4abc64fc91e971f18b3b0d7824a38b501a5d6f4f0c"
    },
    "ag_s3_03": {
      "id": "ag_s3_03",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "ag_s3_03.ogg",
      "text": "太厉害了，枪准词更准，难怪一路打穿防线！",
      "bytes": 29153,
      "sha256": "007821a161059582e3ffbd682cbb1c35337e7297e9ee98bfbfd683880548db42"
    },
    "ag_s4_01": {
      "id": "ag_s4_01",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "ag_s4_01.ogg",
      "text": "不好，那煞星靠过来了！快往后躲，千万别露头！",
      "bytes": 31334,
      "sha256": "f35c23ad606d2c0398f315fc138b2414bc95d7e8fe2bff4b9e6a892d926bd45f"
    },
    "ag_s4_02": {
      "id": "ag_s4_02",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "ag_s4_02.ogg",
      "text": "快退后找掩体！跟他正面打简直是送人头！",
      "bytes": 29899,
      "sha256": "790e5c85199730f59ef532c036dca41b7f9f4d27c75b2ffa6a458982f319ed9a"
    },
    "ag_s4_03": {
      "id": "ag_s4_03",
      "group": "ahsarah_guard",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉卫队",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "gruff_desert_mercenary",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "ag_s4_03.ogg",
      "text": "别过来！他枪法太恐怖了，咱们先避避风头！",
      "bytes": 28888,
      "sha256": "12f95af23bc3ec265d289fc0ca45891210cf9f194e9131df6405783f8451890d"
    },
    "haavk_s1_01": {
      "id": "haavk_s1_01",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage1",
      "file": "haavk_s1_01.ogg",
      "text": "评估完成，目标威胁等级极低，执行快速抓捕。",
      "bytes": 28068,
      "sha256": "ba383ecde816c6759f8173ed54df13ed74381c4fdc6a9c7d2567399104f9bc11"
    },
    "haavk_s1_02": {
      "id": "haavk_s1_02",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage1",
      "file": "haavk_s1_02.ogg",
      "text": "业余入侵者，预计三十秒内解除其武装。",
      "bytes": 24748,
      "sha256": "96360d3f2c10efb1e00ccbb7b5cfaa1f05f9237d987cf256fba9b9e2efefe122"
    },
    "haavk_s2_01": {
      "id": "haavk_s2_01",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "haavk_s2_01.ogg",
      "text": "修正评估：目标命中率偏高，切换谨慎掩体战术。",
      "bytes": 30444,
      "sha256": "c98c0f663276f9ea2457d0a55702c3f9aac66a8d9303591cd03dfd119aca2349"
    },
    "haavk_s2_02": {
      "id": "haavk_s2_02",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage2",
      "file": "haavk_s2_02.ogg",
      "text": "警告，目标具备稳定破词能力，停止正面冒进。",
      "bytes": 28128,
      "sha256": "cea2ff43365982f6e315b12689fac733be45c5cb37dab01e7c997a0b8668548e"
    },
    "haavk_s3_01": {
      "id": "haavk_s3_01",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "haavk_s3_01.ogg",
      "text": "惊人数据：目标枪法精准且词汇库极其深厚，建议全员敬畏应对。",
      "bytes": 37778,
      "sha256": "74251a451440a3dbbdbd698810b5f857353ef816839e336e9240d6985d8b2bab"
    },
    "haavk_s3_02": {
      "id": "haavk_s3_02",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage3",
      "file": "haavk_s3_02.ogg",
      "text": "目标已连续精准破译多层词盾，作战素质远超预期！",
      "bytes": 30084,
      "sha256": "8c74937568b6986b5f810e1fdf65a425cf3a868bbecf5cd3e966837f38a65a53"
    },
    "haavk_s4_01": {
      "id": "haavk_s4_01",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "haavk_s4_01.ogg",
      "text": "高危警报！目标正在逼近，所有常规特勤立刻后撤规避！",
      "bytes": 34252,
      "sha256": "ec552f1b81ab6bbca83453df9c9917989b80260a979909025a7a61b3a6ec0520"
    },
    "haavk_s4_02": {
      "id": "haavk_s4_02",
      "group": "haavk_trooper",
      "speaker": "哈夫克特勤",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "timbre": "cold_corporate_female_radio",
      "tag": "stage4",
      "file": "haavk_s4_02.ogg",
      "text": "战力差距过大，放弃正面交火，优先撤离至远端掩体！",
      "bytes": 30837,
      "sha256": "31ef1291123f647a1b10df3a4a04b4d196d8a55235072e51c96295c0af4b1883"
    },
    "iron_s34_01": {
      "id": "iron_s34_01",
      "group": "boss_ironface",
      "speaker": "雾隐先锋·铁面词卫",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "forged_iron_mask_enforcer",
      "tag": "stage3_4",
      "file": "iron_s34_01.ogg",
      "text": "难怪手下都吓得不敢露头……好，枪法与词功都不错，让我亲自领教！",
      "bytes": 37589,
      "sha256": "6087155c6a5d80e93f25b9766b9474b2947236e6782d18ca9f054d0e3a81abdc"
    },
    "iron_s34_02": {
      "id": "iron_s34_02",
      "group": "boss_ironface",
      "speaker": "雾隐先锋·铁面词卫",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "timbre": "forged_iron_mask_enforcer",
      "tag": "stage3_4",
      "file": "iron_s34_02.ogg",
      "text": "小兵怕你，我铁面词卫可不怕！亮出你的真本事吧！",
      "bytes": 31683,
      "sha256": "c86ca0d412d60dd7d0266f4fa43e0ddb5cd4aa7ecea0f0cb1cc16e2750dd3033"
    },
    "over_s34_01": {
      "id": "over_s34_01",
      "group": "boss_overlord",
      "speaker": "雾隐机关王·玄铁词尊",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "cloud_peak_sovereign_chorus",
      "tag": "stage3_4",
      "file": "over_s34_01.ogg",
      "text": "能逼退雾隐众兵，尔等枪法与词汇确有几分火候，可敢接我玄铁法轮？",
      "bytes": 44184,
      "sha256": "93a38653c676b0e8228c7951ab489afb17b17633818af6922359cd0a7badc381"
    },
    "over_s34_02": {
      "id": "over_s34_02",
      "group": "boss_overlord",
      "speaker": "雾隐机关王·玄铁词尊",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "timbre": "cloud_peak_sovereign_chorus",
      "tag": "stage3_4",
      "file": "over_s34_02.ogg",
      "text": "众卒皆惧尔威名？呵，在本座面前，且看你这双利眼能撑几合！",
      "bytes": 41703,
      "sha256": "17b38e405785b0d8f3d0c1e2da47d242c3c53b01ca66dbc6ab0bf1992aa86206"
    },
    "saeed_s34_01": {
      "id": "saeed_s34_01",
      "group": "boss_saeed",
      "speaker": "赤枭·赛伊德",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
      "timbre": "predatory_hunter_baritone",
      "tag": "stage3_4",
      "file": "saeed_s34_01.ogg",
      "text": "连我的卫队都被你吓得四处躲藏……不错，你终于配做赤枭的猎物了！",
      "bytes": 38382,
      "sha256": "72f739e9e79f545839bbf7e349202299b24d8655bc445a3504e0522fd0545860"
    },
    "saeed_s34_02": {
      "id": "saeed_s34_02",
      "group": "boss_saeed",
      "speaker": "赤枭·赛伊德",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
      "timbre": "predatory_hunter_baritone",
      "tag": "stage3_4",
      "file": "saeed_s34_02.ogg",
      "text": "枪法狠辣，英文也难不倒你——好久没遇过这么像样的对手了！",
      "bytes": 34586,
      "sha256": "834f63ed535bd07a5cc5830f61d11e5a732093d205d18668088263af5951b322"
    },
    "reis_s34_01": {
      "id": "reis_s34_01",
      "group": "boss_reis",
      "speaker": "阿萨拉军阀·雷斯",
      "voice_actor": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
      "timbre": "booming_warlord_gramophone_hall",
      "tag": "stage3_4",
